    <Replace Tag="LOC_SDP_WEIGHT_COVERAGE" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Reach: factories, power plants, zoos, stadiums, aquariums and some wonders help every city of yours within a distance (mostly 6 tiles in the rules); the same kind does not stack. The plan counts the cities it newly covers: each one adds this many points, in the same unit as adjacency; 0 leaves it out. It only decides where the chosen districts go and never adds districts to a city. For reference: a factory gives each covered city +3 production, a power plant +3 to +4 more; zoos, stadiums and aquariums +1 amenity each.</Text>
